# Yume tests

Oracle is [`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md), not the implementation. Assert **literals** (`5`, `50`, `14`). Importing the same constant as the SUT and asserting equality is a tautology.

## Gate

A feature is not done until `pnpm test` (full suite) exits 0. A new file being green is not regression coverage.

Use skill `automating-vocab-pet-tests` for matrix, mocks, and `data-testid` rules.

## Choose the layer before adding a file

| Situation | Test |
| --- | --- |
| Pure function in `src/features`, `src/lib`, `src/config` | Vitest `*.test.ts` next to the module |
| React + props, no SQLite | Vitest + Testing Library `*.test.tsx` if that harness already exists |
| Deck / submit answer | Unit + mock `src/db/*` — do not open SQLite |
| Native tray / two windows | Smoke or manual checklist — not a substitute for unit tests of domain functions |

Do not run `pnpm tauri dev` to "verify" a pure function.

## Invariants to pin

| Law | Literal |
| --- | --- |
| Known / level | `+5` XP; every `50` XP levels up; keep remainder |
| Viewed | `+2` XP |
| Unknown | `0` XP; interval `0` |
| SRS | known: `1, 3, 7, 14`; `mastered` when known count `>= 5` |
| Mood | 0d happy → 1d neutral → 2d sad → 3d+ hungry; **never dies** |
| Scheduler | `<=0` or NaN → `120_000` ms |
| Ship | targets `nsis`+`app`+`dmg`; no `msi`/`pkg`/`all`; NSIS `currentUser` |

Inject `nowMs` / `random`. Do not freeze tests to `Date.now()`.

Locator pattern if DOM tests exist: `data-testid="vp-<surface>-<role>"`. Not Tailwind classes, not Vietnamese copy.
